.Sh BUGS
This is a research utility.  While, as always, care has been taken to ensure
best practices and memory safety it, should not be considered
.Qq safe
for use on say; a public-facing production server. Where there is a potential
of miscreants running the program directly there lies the potential for pain.
You have been warned.
